DESCRIPTION:Born and raised in Madera\, California\, Phil Medina turned a l
 ifelong talent for making people laugh into a nationally touring stand-up c
 omedy career after taking a leap of faith in 2008. His rapid rise earned hi
 m performances at iconic venues including The Ice House\, The Laugh Factory
 \, and The Hollywood Improv\, paving the way for a career that has seen him
  headline comedy clubs and theaters across the country\, win multiple stand
 -up comedy competitions\, and become the national voice of Hungry Howie's P
 izza commercials. Beyond stand-up\, Phil has appeared in feature films on A
 mazon Prime and is currently the voice of a character on a Disney+ series\,
  further showcasing his versatility as a performer. In 2024\, he was select
 ed to perform at the prestigious Netflix Is A Joke Festival\, cementing his
  place among comedy's rising stars. Known for his commanding stage presence
 \, razor-sharp wit\, and effortless ability to connect with audiences\, Phi
